  "idea": "Async peer recognition bot that rewards teammates in public Slack channels",
  "text": "This peer reward bot lets teammates send bonus points and praise directly inside Slack. Annual performance reviews fail to motivate remote staff because feedback arrives months after project milestones wrap up. Without immediate recognition, employees feel isolated behind their screens and disconnected from company mission. Implementing Bonusly enables staff to gift reward points redeemable for gift cards and custom perks instantly. You build continuous peer gratitude on autopilot.",
